{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48020","headline":"与独孤穆冥会诗 六 · 临淄县主","name":"与独孤穆冥会诗 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"露草芊芊，颓茔未迁。\n自我居此，於今几年。\n与君先祖，畴昔恩波。\n死生契阔，忽此相过。\n谁谓佳期，寻当别离。\n俟君之北，携手同归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"临淄县主","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48020.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48020","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}